{"4801630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goblins Against Wood", "steam_appid": 4801630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/df03863d5e1964c51eb3fd7cf06841be.avif?t=1787422634\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Chop Down a Massive Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Goblins Against Wood</i> is a co-op casual game where you and your friends share one simple goal: chop down a single, enormous tree. Work together or alone to carve deeper into the trunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/304e1c0d8353a7095272533f1d50b263.poster.avif?t=1787422634\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/304e1c0d8353a7095272533f1d50b263.webm?t=1787422634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Lost Gold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the tree are nuggets of gold swallowed by the wood long ago.  Search for valuable deposits, and bring your findings back to the merchant. The deeper you chop, the more you'll uncover!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Axe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your hard-earned gold into upgrades for your axe. Increase your chopping power or efficiency. Every upgrade makes a noticeable difference as the tree continues to grow thinner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/e1db704ab65ad59e3a9535c1db686b1f.poster.avif?t=1787422634\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/e1db704ab65ad59e3a9535c1db686b1f.webm?t=1787422634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/e1db704ab65ad59e3a9535c1db686b1f.mp4?t=1787422634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Goblin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your outfit while taking a break at the campfire. Choose an axe that is suitable for the job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/e52d5e1190d680b698aa4023cada20da.poster.avif?t=1787422634\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/e52d5e1190d680b698aa4023cada20da.webm?t=1787422634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/e52d5e1190d680b698aa4023cada20da.mp4?t=1787422634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801630/extras/df03863d5e1964c51eb3fd7cf06841be.avif?t=1787422634\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Chop Down a Massive Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Goblins Against Wood</i> is a co-op casual game where you and your friends share one simple goal: chop down a single, enormous tree. Work together or alone to carve deeper into the trunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\